strong>Devlop WMS<\/strong> pode transformar opera\u00e7\u00f5es log\u00edsticas, proporcionando n\u00e3o s\u00f3 um aumento significativo da produtividade, mas tamb\u00e9m uma melhoria cont\u00ednua nos processos.<\/p><p>O Benfica continua a investir na sua evolu\u00e7\u00e3o, e n\u00f3s, na Devlop, estamos ao seu lado nesta jornada,<strong> sempre a trabalhar em conjunto para alcan\u00e7ar novos patamares de excel\u00eancia no setor log\u00edstico.<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da05e2d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"da05e2d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abb396a elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"abb396a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dbc020b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dbc020b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a012a7c elementor-widget elementor-widget-video\" data-id=\"a012a7c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;youtube_url&quot;:&q